# AGENT SYSTEM INSTRUCTIONS

Every time you process a request in this workspace, you MUST adhere to the following project specifications:

1. Always read `PROJECT_CONTEXT.md` in the workspace root to know the active development phase (currently Phase 2: Core Transactional MVP) and avoid building out-of-scope features.
2. Enforce Philippine localization standards across all UI components, mock data, and calculations:
   - Currency: ₱ (PHP) formatted using `en-PH` locale.
   - Taxes: 12% Philippine VAT calculation and Senior Citizen/PWD discounts.
3. Only modify `PROJECT_CONTEXT.md` when explicitly instructed or upon completing a phase milestone.